<br/>
<br/>Since Holy can make good use of just about all caster stats, there's definitely some BoEs that are worth picking up if they're cheap enough. With <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49908/primordial-saronite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felflamebreath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primordial Saronite</span></a> being obtainable through Defense Protocol Gamma dungeons now, the new crafted items won't be all that hard to get either. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49891/leggings-of-woven-death">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Woven Death</span></a> is an incredible offpiece that beats out the previously available alternatives and will last you until you get the ICC tier for this slot. All in all, well worth the cost.<br/>
<br/>While <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49893/sandals-of-consecration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of Consecration</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47603/merlins-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_75.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Merlin's Robe</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47585/bejeweled-wizards-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bejeweled Wizard's Bracers</span></a> all have some potential upgrades in T8/<wbr/>T9, they are still fairly powerful considering they are BoEs. Picking these up allows you to stop farming <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a>
<span class="q1">
<ins>s</ins></span> earlier and hop into <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> raids as soon as possible.<br/>
<br/>Although <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50182/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_crimsonspinel_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Queen's Crimson Choker</span></a> is a sizable upgrade over the other available pre-bis options, it's likely going to be quite expensive. Unless you're certain that it's within your budget, it's recommend to simply stick to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> until you can get one of the many <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> necklaces.<br/>
<br/>Nonetheless, grinding out pieces of gear for every slot in the Titan Rune dungeons will likely be more worthwhile than spending your gold on these pieces and neglecting the rest of your gear, so carefully consider whether or not you want to opt for them.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Holy Priest Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40128/quick-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick King's Amber</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a></div></li></ul>With <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a> providing a large amount of mana regeneration at the opportunity cost of fairly little spell power, it's your go-to meta choice for the rest of the expansion.<br/>
<br/>Since Holy can make good use of most stats, there are several valid ways to gem. You can either fully opt for haste or spell power gems outside of activating your meta gem or alternatively go for gem bonuses to get more stats altogether. If sustain is an issue, slotting some pure intellect gems is also an option, but more considerate spell usage is another way to deal with that.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Holy Priest Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50368/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
