<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Two-Handed Weapon - <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62948/enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Staff - Greater Spellpower</span></a></div></li></ul>You can choose between the crit and mp5 enchants in the head and shoulder slots, though the difference is not particularly noticeable.<br/>Finally, the profession options above are the ones of the optimal two professions, but alternatives that do not require professions are also listed.</div>